  "description": "\n <p><font color=\"#c24f4a\"><b>Please leave your customized information in the order notes if you purchase the custom version. Orders without custom content will be shipped with the standard regular version.</b></font></p>\n <p><b><font color=\"#c24f4a\"><br></font></b></p>\n <p><b><font color=\"#c24f4a\">This is an original design with registered copyright for the pattern.</font></b><br>We are the manufacturer and support wholesale with in-stock items.<br>Product Introduction:<br>Standard Version (As shown in pictures): Printed with the words \"My Reading Journey\" on the base.<br>Blank Custom Version: Custom name service costs an extra 8 yuan. You can also DIY the content by yourself.<br>Package Includes: Main board + base + 3 hooks + 30 number pieces (3 pieces for each number from 0 to 9).<br>Product Dimensions:<br>Overall size: 25.8*21*5cm<br>Main board: 25*18.2*0.5cm<br>Base: 21*5*1cm<br>Number piece: 2.9*1.8*0.3cm<br>Weight:<br>Total weight: approx. 160g<br>Main board + base + 3 hooks: 138.3g<br>10 number pieces: 7g<br>Packaging: Packed with OPP bag and paper box.<br>Package size: 21.5*3.5*29CM, package weight: approx. 250g<br>Carton Information:<br>Carton size: 46*31*45CM<br>Quantity per carton: 24 sets<br>Total carton weight: around 6KG</p>\n <p><br></p>\n <p>Customizable Personalized Design<br>This wooden reading tracker comes with a blank nameplate, you can customize the name or slogan on the base freely. It can be turned into your exclusive mini library to record your reading journey throughout the year.<br>Vintage Exquisite Craftsmanship<br>Made of high-quality solid wood with delicate color printing. The retro arched bookshelf shape and vivid colorful book patterns restore the charm of an old library, bringing classic decorative style to your desk.<br>Fun Reading Goal Tracker<br>It is a creative book counter. Every time you finish a book, you can fill in the record slot, which helps you track your yearly reading progress and keep your reading goals on track.<br>Perfect Desktop Home Decor<br>Compact size fits nicely on desks, bookshelves, study tables and bedroom countertops. The antique mini bookshelf ornament adds warm literary atmosphere to home, study and office space.<br>Ideal Gift for Book Lovers<br>A thoughtful present for readers, bookworms, students and bibliophiles on birthdays, Christmas and book festivals. It is both a reading log tool and a literary keepsake gift.</p>\n",
